  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the wreckage of old Subchain City, 'Gumshoe' grew up scavenging for scraps and DRIP. Living in the Hideout Duck Billit fostered a gruff resourcefulness. The discovery of El Macho Malard's old helmet marked him as a leader in his flock, even if he couldn't fill the shoes of the legend.",
    "class": "Bruiser",
    "name": "'Gumshoe' Gumbo",
    "personality": "Sardonic and pragmatic. Gumshoe always has a cynical quip ready, but he deeply cares for his flock. Despite his 'dead-eyes' look, he's perceptive and surprisingly good at spotting ambushes, probably from all the bubblegum.",
